{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[13],"Id":27,"TextResource":{"Name":"cafriccio-proximamente","Translations":[{"Text":"Cafriccio (Próximamente)","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Cafriccio (Próximamente)","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"1","Id":260}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Caffriccio es pasión por el café y otros productos exquisitos. Se dirige a los sibaritas del café, y constituye un espacio para combinar el placer del café con el de relajarse mientras se espera el vuelo.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Caffriccio means passion for coffee and other exquisite products. It is targeted at coffee connoisseurs and is a space to combine the pleasure of a good cup of coffee with a chance to wind down while you wait for your flight.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1488916772","Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/cafeterias\/cafriccio-pr%C3%B3ximamente","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/cafeterias\/cafriccio-pr%C3%B3ximamente","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/027_cafriccio-proximamente.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/27\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/027_cafriccio-proximamente.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/27\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}